sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-morphometric-validation> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Tozluoglu et al. (2019) Dev. Cell & Sui et al. (2018) Nat. Commun. Drosophila wing imaginal disc planar differential growth, basal ECM dome & H/N, H/H, H/P hinge folding (Pass 3: + reduced disc-proper / peripodial / lumen sac) — Morphometric validation: 80/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Credited: `measure_morphoeval()` (L1603-1751) returns 13 measurements, 5 new in Pass 3 (L1617-1668): coupled-sac dome 53.91 um (ref 54.0), coupled d_HH 19.65 um (ref 19.4), self-consistent p = 0.62 Pa (prediction), maximal fold-locus shift 0.0 across the sweep (ref 0.0), p_half = 372.5 Pa (prediction); the Pass 2 eight remain (dome r = 0.9977, 15-fold r = 0.9953, zone r = 1.0000, Collagenase kappa = 0, specimen s_HH = 0.391, pouch fraction 0.474). Deductions: the zone-curvature r = 1.0000 compares hard-coded 0.0148/0.0151 hinge, 0.0042 notum and -0.0020 x depth fold values (L879-885) with the reference, so it validates nothing (-6); the uniform-growth positional SD discards the 12 solved replicates and appends U(0.18, 0.68) draws (L970) while the WT pinned SD uses the reference SD as its generating sigma (L975) (-5); the uniform-growth fold depths are set equal to their targets (L474-476) instead of measured on the relaxed surface (-3); two of the five new measurements carry `reference_value: None` (L1643, L1663) and the dome / d_HH references are the same prescribed targets as in model-fidelity (-2); the one measurement that is a genuine out-of-sample prediction (p_half) has no published value to test against, which is stated honestly (0)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "2020-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding.py L474–L476: Uniform-growth d_hn/d_hh/d_hp set equal to the prescribed targets <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/028758bc/2020-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding.py#L474-L476>",
            "2020-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding.py L879–L885: 7-zone curvature: hinge 0.0148/0.0151, notum 0.0042, fold -0.0020*depth hard-coded; r = 1.0000 is copied <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/028758bc/2020-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding.py#L879-L885>",
            "2020-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding.py L958–L975: Uniform-growth SD sampled via rng_rep.uniform(0.18, 0.68); WT pinned SD drawn with the reference SD as sigma <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/028758bc/2020-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding.py#L958-L975>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-measurement-15-point-h-n-h-h-and-h-p-fold-depth-developmental-correlation-64h-96h-ael>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-measurement-64h-96h-ael-pouch-dome-elevation-trajectory-correlation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-measurement-7-zone-spatial-curvature-correlation-across-notum-hinge-ridges-fold-troughs-and-pouch-dome>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-measurement-collagenase-vkg-rnai-basal-ecm-ablation-pouch-dome-curvature-kappa-dome>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-measurement-coupled-dp-pe-lumen-sac-96-h-ael-wild-type-central-h-h-fold-depth-d-hh>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-measurement-coupled-dp-pe-lumen-sac-96-h-ael-wild-type-pouch-dome-height-volume-mode-lumen>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-measurement-imposed-lumen-pressure-at-which-the-96-h-pouch-dome-height-halves-p-half-model-prediction>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-measurement-mature-96-h-ael-wild-type-central-h-h-fold-depth-d-hh>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-measurement-maximal-h-n-h-h-h-p-fold-locus-shift-across-the-0-800-pa-imposed-lumen-pressure-sweep>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-measurement-self-consistent-lumen-hydrostatic-pressure-at-96-h-ael-volume-mode-model-prediction>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-measurement-specimen-cv-segmented-h-h-fold-normalized-position-s-hh-l-drosophila-wing-disc-specimen-jpg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-measurement-specimen-cv-segmented-wing-pouch-dome-zone-fraction-1-s-hp-l>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-measurement-uniform-proliferation-unpinned-buckling-positional-standard-deviation-sigma-s-l>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-morphometric-validation-1> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.8"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-measurement-15-point-h-n-h-h-and-h-p-fold-depth-developmental-correlation-64h-96h-ael> a schema:PropertyValue,
